  "d0Note": "2026-06-08: D0 reached. tools/pdv-diegetic-author (Mutagen) authored the 17 D1 records (5 IMAD + 5 SNDR + 1 MUSC duplicated from the vanillaSourceSelections; 4 SPEL+MGEF shaders carrying the EFSH; 1 MISC + 1 BOOK placeholders) plus the 2 SGE quests (PDV_DiegeticDeps, PDV_DiegeticDirector) with full VMAD into PlayerDevotion_Framework.esp (with backup). Manager PDV_DiegeticDirectorService wired -> PDV_DiegeticDirector. SEQ refreshed (37->39, both diegetic quests included). pdv-diegetic-author --check PASS, pdv_verify 0 FAIL, pdv_diegetic_ux_check 0 FAIL, content_verify PASS=1081, daedric --check PASS (no regression). D1Enabled=false so D0 is zero-behavior-change. REMAINING: in-game D0 smoke (load, confirm no behavior change / no missing-property log), then set the PDV_DiegeticDirector D1Enabled property true and run the counted-transition proof (tier/neglect/curse fire once each). Optional polish: confirm the candidate sources (Hollow/Distant SNDR, Dread EFSH, MISC/BOOK), recolor IMAD/EFSH per palette.",
  "progressNote": "2026-06-08: Papyrus side wired LIVE on main. PDV_DiegeticDeps + PDV_DiegeticDirector promoted to the live Source and added to pdv_compile ACTIVE_SCRIPTS; the diegetic director hooks (property PDV_DiegeticDirectorService, _diegeticLoadHandled flag, HandleDiegeticLoad/RefreshDiegeticMedallion/NotifyDiegeticRoutineFavor/SurfaceTransition/SurfaceCurseTransitionDiegetic + GetCurseSurface*) are merged into the live PDV__ManagerQuest with call sites at OnInit/OnUpdate load, tier reach, neglect drop, curse transition, dawn medallion, and the 4 Dunmer/Khajiit routine favors. All three scripts compile 0/0; pdv_verify 0 FAIL; pdv_diegetic_ux_check all PASS. Every diegetic call self-guards on `if PDV_DiegeticDirectorService`, so with the director quest not yet created the property is None and all calls no-op -- this is effectively D0 with zero behavior change and is safe to load now. REMAINING (CK or a Mutagen author + in-game): create the 17 d1Records from vanillaSourceSelections, create the 2 SGE quests (PDV_DiegeticDeps, PDV_DiegeticDirector) + attach scripts + wire all VMAD properties incl. manager PDV_DiegeticDirectorService -> PDV_DiegeticDirector, SEQ refresh, D0 smoke, then D1Enabled=true counted-transition proof.",
  "liveWritePolicy": {
    "sourceOnlyUntilApproved": true,
    "sourcePromotionRequiresCleanCheck": "node tools/pdv_diegetic_ux_check.mjs",
    "liveCompileRequires": "node tools/pdv_compile.mjs --script PDV_DiegeticDeps --script PDV_DiegeticDirector --script PDV__ManagerQuest",
    "noLiveStepsInThisWorktreePass": [
      "no live MO2 source copy",
      "no live PEX compile",
      "no CK record write",
      "no ESP VMAD property write",
      "no SEQ refresh",
      "no in-game proof claim"
    ]
  },
